  "rationale": "The plant G1 models the robot's combined perception and motion capabilities, with states encoding the current obstacle configuration and action commitment. The specification E1 binds perception outcomes to safe, coverage-oriented actions, ensuring forward progress when clear, conservative recovery on obstacles, and escalation to full_rotate only after repeated failures. E2 prevents repeated rotation or random_walk actions to avoid oscillation and promote coverage.",
