    "Encode all obstacle and clear sensor outcomes as uncontrollable events in the plant, with action-commitment states for each controllable action.",
    "Specifications bind each perception outcome to exactly one safe action, enforce recovery escalation, and prevent repeated recovery or exploration actions to maximize coverage and avoid oscillations."
